olklore says a house will prosper if a Snorunt lives there.",[25]="Snorunt live in regions with heavy snowfall. In seasons without snow, such as spring and summer, this Pokémon steals away to live quietly among stalactites and stalagmites deep in caverns.",[26]="Snorunt survives by eating only snow and ice. Old folklore claims that a house visited by this Pokémon is sure to prosper for many generations to come.",[27]="Their numbers seem to have rapidly increased in Alola. Custom has it that houses where Snorunt live will be prosperous for generations to come.",[28]="It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as -150 degrees Fahrenheit.",[29]="It feeds mainly on ice and snow. It’s only able to survive in a limited number of places in the warm Alola region.",[30]="Rich people from cold areas all share childhood memories of playing with Snorunt.",[33]="It’s said that if they are seen at midnight, they’ll cause heavy snow. They eat snow and ice to survive.",[34]="It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as −150 degrees Fahrenheit.",[39]="Arrives alongside the first snow. It's thought that homes Snorunt visit will prosper for many generations. By tradition, one might offer a lump of ice made from pure water at one's front door."},es={[23]="Se dice que se reúnen en grupos bajo hojas gigantescas y viven allí en total armonía.",[24]="En las zonas nevadas, las leyendas dicen que si un Snorunt vive en una casa, trae prosperidad.",[25]="Snorunt vive en zonas de grandes nevadas. En primavera y verano, cuando no nieva, se retira a las cavernas para vivir tranquilamente entre estalactitas y estalagmitas.",[26]="Snorunt sobrevive alimentándose solo de nieve y hielo. Se dice que la casa por la que pase este Pokémon estará llena de prosperidad durante generaciones.",[27]="Su número ha aumentado en la región de Alola. Dicen que traen prosperidad durante generaciones a las casas en las que habitan.",[28]="Las regiones frías son su hábitat natural. Se encuentra a sus anchas en lugares donde la temperatura alcanza los -100 °C.",[29]="Se alimenta sobre todo de hielo y nieve. Debido a las temperaturas cálidas que reinan en Alola, solo puede habitar en contados lugares.",[30]="Según parece, en las regiones frías todos los miembros de las familias pudientes recuerdan haber jugado con Snorunt en su infancia.",[33]="Dicen que, si aparece a medianoche, provoca grandes nevadas. Se alimenta de nieve y hielo.",[34]="Las regiones frías son su hábitat natural. Se encuentra a sus anchas incluso en lugares donde la temperatura alcanza los -100 °C."},pt="Chega junto com a primeira neve. Acredita-se que as casas visitadas por Snorunt prosperam por muitas gerações. Por tradição, pode-se oferecer um bloco de gelo feito de água pura na porta de casa."},evo={{s=361},{s=362,from=361,c={{t="level-up",lv=42}}},{s=478,from=361,c={{t="use-item",item=109,gender=1}}}},moves={[5]={1,181,1,43,7,104,10,44,16,196,19,29,25,182,28,242,34,58,37,258,43,59},[6]={1,181,1,43,7,104,10,44,16,196,19,29,25,182,28,242,34,58,37,258,43,59},[7]={1,181,1,43,7,104,10,44,16,196,19,29,25,182,28,242,34,58,37,258,43,59},[8]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[9]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[10]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[11]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[12]={1,181,1,43,7,104,10,44,16,196,19,29,25,182,28,242,34,58,37,258,43,59},[13]={1,181,1,43,7,104,10,44,16,196,19,29,25,182,28,242,34,58,37,258,43,59},[14]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[15]={1,181,1,43,4,104,10,44,13,196,19,29,22,182,28,423,31,242,37,420,40,258,46,59},[16]={1,181,1,43,5,104,10,420,14,196,19,44,23,423,28,29,32,182,37,524,41,242,46,59,50,258},[17]={1,181,1,43,5,104,10,420,14,196,19,44,23,423,28